# Large binaries and local outputs
TEST CLIPS/
out/
*.zip

# Working folders: keep the folders and their notes, never the media
Inbox/*
Processed/*
Outbox/*
!Inbox/README.txt
!Processed/README.txt
!Outbox/README.txt

# [2026-09-06, audit DC-4] The per-kit TEXT records are tracked; the media never is.
# `Outbox/*` wholesale already swallowed every 2026-07-25 kit's result.json (the paid
# evidence — DOCS/LIVE-FIRE.md:121-129) and left the one surviving $3.83 record in an
# unbacked local folder. A kit folder must be un-ignored for its files to be, so the
# folder pattern comes first; depth.mp4 / source.mp4 / preview.mp4 / still.png /
# sheet.png / prompt.txt / binding.txt / README.txt / variants/ stay ignored via the
# re-ignore line below — `git check-ignore -v` each one to prove it (tests/test_gitignore.py).
!Outbox/*/
Outbox/*/*
!Outbox/*/kit.json
!Outbox/*/result.json
!Outbox/INDEX.txt
